OL,3,ATrident submarine returns home after
OL,4,Arecord-breaking undersea patrol
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe typical patrol length for the UK's
OL,7,FVanguard-class ballistic missile
OL,8,Fsubmarines has more than doubled in
OL,9,Frecent years, with six-month durations
OL,10,Fnow routine due to a shortage of
OL,11,Fseaworthy vessels.
